<title>USA: MedCath leases mobile labs to 4 hospitals.</title>
<headline>MedCath leases mobile labs to 4 hospitals.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>MedCath Inc said four hospitals in the states of Kentucky, Florida and Michigan have agreed to lease MedCath's mobile laboratories.</p>
<p>The company did not provide details of the agreements.</p>
<p>The mobile labs allow hospitals to provide cardiac care during high volume times or during equipment and facility upgrades.</p>
</text>
